## Command

```shell
biome lint --baseline --only=suspicious '<TEMP_DIR>/baseline_err_when_baseline_and_only_are_passed'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "preset": "none",
      "suspicious": { "noDebugger": "error", "noDoubleEquals": "warn" },
      "complexity": { "noUselessCatch": "error" }
    }
  }
}
```

## `a.js`

```js
debugger;
debugger;

```

